# scUTRquant APA Pipeline — Pineda Dataset (Test Run)

## Overview

This document describes a full end-to-end workflow for running **alternative polyadenylation (APA)** analysis using **scUTRquant** on single-cell RNA-seq data from the Pineda dataset on the Minerva HPC cluster.

This pipeline includes:

1. Data access and setup on HPC
2. scUTRquant execution (Snakemake-based)
3. Generation of SingleCellExperiment (SCE) objects
4. Metadata integration
5. Pseudobulk aggregation
6. Differential transcript usage (DTU) analysis
7. Visualization (volcano plots)

This is a **test run** using publicly available data to validate the pipeline prior to application on in-house datasets.

