## 21. Disease Collapsing (Critical)

```r
library(dplyr)

sce$disease <- case_when(
  sce$disease_group == "Control" ~ "Control",
  sce$disease_group %in% c("sALS","c9ALS") ~ "ALS",
  sce$disease_group %in% c("sFTLD","c9FTLD") ~ "FTLD"
)

table(sce$disease, sce$disease_group)
```

