## 22. Pseudobulk Aggregation

### Full dataset

```r
library(scuttle)

pb <- aggregateAcrossCells(
  sce,
  ids = sce$sample_id,
  use.assay.type = "counts"
)
```

### Microglia-only

```r
sce_mg <- sce[, sce$cell_type == "microglia"]

pb_mg <- aggregateAcrossCells(
  sce_mg,
  ids = sce_mg$sample_id,
  use.assay.type = "counts"
)
```

