## Notes

* This pipeline was ran on this test dataset prior to use on in-house data.
* Downstream analyses may vary depending on biological question (e.g., microglia-specific APA in PD).
* No filtering thresholds beyond `min_umis = 500` were applied at the scUTRquant stage.
* Sex was included as a covariate in all DTU models.

